{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1548517","title":"Microbial sequencing data, ARTofMELT 2023","description":"This dataset contains metadata associated with bacterial (16S rRNA gene) and eukaryotic (18S rRNA gene) sequencing of Arctic marine source samples, ambient bioaerosols, and sea spray aerosols generated during onboard simulation experiments. The data were collected to characterize microbial communities in Arctic bioaerosols and investigate potential local marine sources and the transfer of microorganisms to the atmosphere.Samples and experimental data were collected during the ARTofMELT 2023 expedition from 7 May to 15 June 2023, with subsequent DNA extraction and next-generation sequencing analyses performed after the expedition.Marine source samples and ambient bioaerosols were collected directly, while sea spray aerosols were generated in onboard sea spray simulation chamber (SSSC) experiments and analyzed using 16S and 18S rRNA gene sequencing to characterize bacterial and eukaryotic community composition, respectively.Samples were collected and experiments were conducted aboard the Swedish icebreaker Oden in the central Arctic Ocean and the corresponding sequence data are deposited in the NCBI Sequence Read Archive (SRA).","center":"Aarhus University","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2026/10/21 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN64342050","KS1","non_urban",null,"2023-05-16",2023,null,null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,"Arctic Ocean: Fram Strait",null,"Arctic","Arctic Ocean","Air","environmental sample from a non-urban site"],["SAMN64342051","KS2","non_urban",null,"2023-05-18",2023,null,null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,"Arctic Ocean: Fram Strait",null,"Arctic","Arctic Ocean","Air","envi